          {
            "title": "Introduction",
            "id": 86509,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni hanno bisogno di <strong>più parametri</strong> per eseguire attività su più elementi di dati, come il nome e il cognome di un nuovo giocatore.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #F0F8FF&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    padding: 10px;&#xA;    margin: 10px;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Add Team Players&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Signup&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;playerInput&quot;&gt; &#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;firstNameInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;First Name&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;surnameInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Last Name&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt; &#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Current Team&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=playerList&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let number = 0;&#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    if (number &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Team Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const firstName = document.getElementById(&quot;firstNameInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     const surname = document.getElementById(&quot;surnameInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     const node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Added: &quot; + firstName +&#xA;      &quot; &quot; + surname);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;playerList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     number++;&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;firstNameInput&quot;).value = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;surnameInput&quot;).value = &quot;&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Previously",
            "id": 86514,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo creare funzioni con un singolo parametro come <code>display(first_name)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first_name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first_name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>display</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>first_name</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'intestazione della funzione e l'istruzione di visualizzazione in modo che la chiamata mostri <code>Alex</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first_name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first_name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"first\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"last_name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>display</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>first_name</code>, <code>)</code> e infine <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Comma",
            "id": 86511,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere più parametri a una funzione, scrivi una <strong>virgola</strong> seguita dal nome del parametro successivo, ad esempio <code>last</code> per il cognome.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere un altro parametro, scrivi una virgola seguita dal suo nome.</p><p>Aggiungi il parametro usato per il cognome in modo che la chiamata mostri <code>Alex Morgan</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"first\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 86535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per passare un secondo valore alla funzione, come il cognome <code>\"Morgan\"</code>, scrivi una virgola seguita dal valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per passare un altro valore in una chiamata di funzione, scrivi una virgola seguita dal valore.</p><p>Completa la chiamata in modo che il codice mostri <code>Alex Morgan</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 86510,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver aggiunto il nuovo parametro e aver passato un valore corrispondente, possiamo usarlo all'interno della funzione, come qui con <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>, seguito da <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver aggiunto un parametro e passato un valore corrispondente, possiamo usarlo nella funzione, come qui con <code>last</code>.</p><p>Usa entrambi i parametri per mostrare <code>Alex Morgan</code>, con uno spazio tra i nomi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;first&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;last&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>first</code>, seguito da <code>\" \"</code> e infine <code>last</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Order",
            "id": 86512,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Passiamo i valori a una funzione nell'ordine dei parametri, come qui con <code>\"Alex\"</code> per <code>first</code> e <code>\"Morgan\"</code> per <code>last</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Alex\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori riempiono i parametri in ordine. Passa entrambi i nomi in modo che il codice stampi <code>Alex Morgan</code> in quest'ordine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, last)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Morgan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Alexander&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Alex Morgan\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Alex\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"Morgan\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple parameters",
            "id": 86513,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo aggiungere tutti i parametri che vogliamo, purché li separiamo con virgole, come qui con <code>third</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;First place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Second place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Third place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First place: Kim\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second place: Lee\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third place: Ava\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi aggiungere tutti i parametri necessari, separandoli con virgole.</p><p>Aggiungi un terzo parametro in modo che l'ultima riga mostri <code>Third place: Ava</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;First place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Second place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Third place: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ava&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"second\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"First place: Kim\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Second place: Lee\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Third place: Ava\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Comma",
            "id": 86519,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale segno separa i parametri di una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione richiede i parametri <code>first</code> e <code>second</code>. Quale intestazione li separa correttamente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>def show(first, second):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>def show(first; second):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>def show(first second):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>def show(first, second):</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 86520,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti parametri può avere una funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quante ne vogliamo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Al massimo tre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quante ne vogliamo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una funzione ha già tre parametri, ma ora richiede un quarto valore. Che cosa puoi fare?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungere un quarto parametro alla definizione.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mantenerne tre perché Python consente al massimo tre parametri.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituire un parametro esistente perché il numero non può aumentare.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungere un quarto parametro alla definizione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Order",
            "id": 86521,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando chiami una funzione, come passi i valori alla funzione quando ha più parametri?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nell'ordine in cui i parametri sono inseriti nella definizione della funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">In qualsiasi ordine</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nell'ordine in cui i parametri sono inseriti nella definizione della funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>def label(city, country):</code>, come assegna i valori <code>label(\"Paris\", \"France\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>city</code> riceve <code>\"Paris\"</code> e <code>country</code> riceve <code>\"France\"</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>city</code> riceve <code>\"France\"</code> e <code>country</code> riceve <code>\"Paris\"</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambi i parametri ricevono <code>\"Paris\"</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>city</code> riceve <code>\"Paris\"</code> e <code>country</code> riceve <code>\"France\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Order 2",
            "id": 86525,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore viene visualizzato per ultimo nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1st: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joe</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Helen</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Joe</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché <code>Joe</code> appare nella seconda riga dell'output?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"show_winners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + first)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + second)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"show_winners(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1st: Helen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il secondo argomento diventa <code>second</code>, usato dal secondo <code>print()</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python stampa gli argomenti della funzione in ordine alfabetico.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il secondo argomento sostituisce il valore di <code>first</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il secondo argomento diventa <code>second</code>, usato dal secondo <code>print()</code>.</p></body></html>"
