            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"combine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"result = combine(\" /><text value=\"&quot;big&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;wolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"bigbadwolf\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bigbadwolf</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>wolfbadbig</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>bigbadwolf</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La console qui sotto mostra <code>bigbadwolf</code>. Quale chiamata farebbe mostrare a <code>print(result)</code> invece <code>wolfbadbig</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"combine\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first + second + third\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"result = combine(\" /><text value=\"&quot;big&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bad&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;wolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(result)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"bigbadwolf\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>combine(\"wolf\", \"bad\", \"big\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>combine(\"big\", \"bad\", \"wolf\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>combine(\"bad\", \"wolf\", \"big\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>combine(\"wolf\", \"bad\", \"big\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
