            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione unisce i parametri in ordine. Assegna un nome ai tre parametri affinché il codice visualizzi <code>PeterPiperPicked</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script1.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"mix\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first, second, third)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(first + second + third)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mix(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Peter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Piper&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fourth\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"PeterPiperPicked\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>first</code>, seguito da <code>second</code> e infine <code>third</code>.</p></body></html>"
